he class), called"] [904 2 "// with the class first"] [969 2 "// classmethod, staticmethod (funcobject.c): a subclass's instance is an Instance around the Go value, so every"] [970 2 "// slot unwraps; __init__ copies the wrapped callable's attributes (functools_wraps) into the dict"] [996 19 "// a classmethod made by a program, not a built-in type's descriptor"] [1022 3 "// a built-in type's classmethod_descriptor: a builtin_function_or_method bound to the class (dict.fromkeys)"] [1080 3 "// descriptor_get_wrapped_attribute and its setter: the dict first, the callable's value kept there"] [1125 2 "// property"] [1257 2 "// __slots__' members"] [1338 2 "// super"] [1385 5 "// a built-in type's method, or a method descriptor in a heap type's dict (methodDescrs: _ast's AST,"] [1386 5 "// queue 202c: super().__init__ in a node class's subclass)"] [1414 53 "// a subclass of super: its type called"] [1436 2 "// mappingproxy"] [1438 2 "// mappingproxy(mapping), over a dict (PY6a: enum's __members__); other mappings are the data model's"] [1446 3 "// an exact dict by its storage; a dict subclass (OrderedDict) as the mapping it is, so its repr and its"] [1447 3 "// comparison are its own (mappingproxy_new keeps the object; queue 278: inspect's Signature.parameters)"] [1451 3 "// mappingproxy_check_mapping: PyMapping_Check, not a list or a tuple"] [1464 2 "// a built-in type's own slots' wrappers (ownSlots, registry.go) are in its __dict__ too (PY5e, part 2b)"] [1472 14 "// a built-in type's attribute descriptors (type.__dict__['__annotations__']: annotationlib)"] [1504 2 "// mappingproxy_richcompare: the mapping's own comparison (queue 202: mappingproxy({}) == {} was False; test_re's"] [1505 2 "// test_getattr compares a pattern's groupindex with a dict)"] [1530 2 "// mappingproxy_or: the mappings beneath, a proxy's unwrapped on either side"] [1557 4 "// a built-in type's getsets and slot wrappers as its subscript has them (queue 290, 286's regression:"] [1558 4 "// enum's _